# LocalRank AI Deployment Guide

## Overview

LocalRank AI is a full-stack web application for generating local SEO content using AI. This guide covers deployment to Vercel using GitHub Actions.

## Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    LocalRank AI Platform                     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Frontend (React + Tailwind)    │    Backend (Express.js)    │
│  Deployed on Vercel             │    Deployed on Vercel      │
│  - Landing Page                 │    - AI Generation API     │
│  - Dashboard                    │    - PayPal Checkout       │
│  - User Auth (Supabase)         │    - PayPal Webhook        │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                    Supabase Database                         │
│  - Authentication (auth.users)                              │
│  - User Profiles & Credits                                  │
│  - Generated SEO Kits                                        │
│  - Payment History                                          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                  External Services                           │
│  - PayPal: Payment Processing (09977457879)                 │
│  - OpenAI: Content Generation                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Prerequisites

1. GitHub account
2. Supabase account
3. PayPal Developer account
4. OpenAI account
5. Vercel account

## Step-by-Step Setup

### 1. Supabase Setup
- Create new project
- Copy Project URL and API keys
- Run SQL migrations in SQL Editor
- Verify tables created

**Save these values:**
```
SUPABASE_URL =
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY =
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY =
```

### 2. PayPal Setup
- Create REST API app
- Get Client ID and Secret
- Note receiver: **09977457879**

**Save these values:**
```
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID =
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET =
PAYPAL_MODE = sandbox
PAYPAL_RECEIVER_ACCOUNT = 09977457879
PAYPAL_RECEIVER_EMAIL = (your verified paypal business email)
```

### 3. OpenAI Setup
- Create API key
- Save:
```
LLM_API_KEY =
```

### 4. Vercel Setup
- Create frontend project from repo root
- Create backend project from `server` folder
- Get token and project IDs

**Save these values:**
```
VERCEL_TOKEN =
VERCEL_ORG_ID =
VERCEL_PROJECT_ID_FRONTEND =
VERCEL_PROJECT_ID_BACKEND =
FRONTEND_URL = https://your-frontend.vercel.app
```

### 5. GitHub Setup
Add all these secrets in:
https://github.com/zurabmiraato-bot/Abdulhalem-s-Lovable/settings/secrets/actions

| Secret Name | Value |
|-------------|-------|
| SUPABASE_URL | your_supabase_url |
| SUPABASE_ANON_KEY | your_anon_key |
| SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY | your_service_role_key |
| PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID | your_paypal_client_id |
| PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET | your_paypal_client_secret |
| PAYPAL_RECEIVER_ACCOUNT | 09977457879 |
| PAYPAL_RECEIVER_EMAIL | your_business_email |
| PAYPAL_MODE | sandbox |
| LLM_API_KEY | your_openai_key |
| VERCEL_TOKEN | your_vercel_token |
| VERCEL_ORG_ID | your_org_id |
| VERCEL_PROJECT_ID_FRONTEND | frontend_project_id |
| VERCEL_PROJECT_ID_BACKEND | backend_project_id |
| NODE_ENV | production |
| FRONTEND_URL | https://your-frontend.vercel.app |

### 6. Deploy

```bash
git push origin main
```

GitHub Actions will automatically:
- Build frontend and backend
- Run tests
- Deploy to Vercel

### 7. PayPal Webhook Configuration

After backend deploys:
- Go to PayPal Developer Dashboard
- Add webhook endpoint:
  - URL: `https://your-backend-domain.com/api/paypal-webhook`
  - Events:
    - PAYMENT.SALE.COMPLETED
    - BILLING.SUBSCRIPTION.CANCELLED

### 8. Test the Application

1. Visit frontend URL
2. Sign up with test email
3. Go to dashboard
4. Generate SEO kit
5. Upgrade to Pro
6. Complete PayPal sandbox payment
7. Verify credits update to 1000

## Environment Variables Reference

### Frontend
```bash
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key
VITE_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=your_paypal_client_id
VITE_PAYPAL_MODE=sandbox
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.vercel.app
```

### Backend
```bash
SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_service_role_key
PAYPAL_MODE=sandbox
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=your_paypal_client_id
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=your_paypal_client_secret
PAYPAL_RECEIVER_ACCOUNT=09977457879
PAYPAL_RECEIVER_EMAIL=your_business_email
LLM_API_KEY=your_openai_key
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3001
FRONTEND_URL=https://your-frontend.vercel.app
```

## Monitoring & Maintenance

### Check Deployment Status
- GitHub Actions tab
- Vercel logs
- Supabase logs

### Common Issues

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Payment fails | Check PAYPAL_MODE and credentials |
| Credits not deducting | Check Supabase RLS |
| API returns 401 | Check x-user-id header |
| Build fails | Check env vars on Vercel |

## Going Live (Production)

### 1. Create Live PayPal App
- Get live credentials
- Update secrets

### 2. Update GitHub Secrets
```
PAYPAL_MODE = live
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID = your_live_client_id
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET = your_live_client_secret
```

### 3. Update PayPal Webhook
- Change to production backend URL

